## Паттерны проекта (для справки)

### Регистрация роутера
```python
# bot/handlers/имя.py
router = Router()

@router.message(Command("команда"))
async def handle_command(message: Message, state: FSMContext):
    ...
```

### FSM-диалог
```python
# bot/states.py
class MyStates(StatesGroup):
    waiting_for_input = State()
    waiting_for_confirm = State()

# в хендлере
await state.set_state(MyStates.waiting_for_input)
data = await state.get_data()
await state.update_data(key=value)
await state.clear()
```

### Подключение роутера
```python
# bot/handlers/__init__.py
from .имя import router as имя_router

def register_all_handlers(dp: Dispatcher):
    dp.include_router(имя_router)
```
